SUMMARY:Toronto East Rotary Club's 13th Annual Arts and Crafts Sale
DESCRIPTION:13th Annual Arts & Crafts Sale hosted by the Toronto East Rotary Club\, happening on Saturday\, November 21st\, 2026 from 11:00 AM to 6:00 PM at Danforth Multifaith Commons (Eastminster)\, 310 Danforth Ave – just steps from Chester subway station.\nThis one-day-only community event features:\n🛍️ Local Artisans & Makers – Unique gifts\, handmade goods\, art\, jewellery\, home décor\, and more\n🎶 Live Music Performances\n🎨 Face Painting for all\n☕ Delicious Refreshments & Goods\n💖 All in support of local charities: Out of the Cold\, Nourish East End Food Bank\, and Toronto East Rotary Club\n🧡 Admission is FREE\, and all ages are welcome!
URL:https://beachmetro.com/event/toronto-east-rotary-clubs-13th-annual-arts-and-crafts-sale/
LOCATION:East End United Regional Ministry\, 1470 Gerrard Street East\, Toronto\, M4K 1N6
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://d28bcn7yu97icd.cloudfront.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/28133657/Arts-and-crafts-sponsors-small-Oct-23-2026-Final.jpg
