SUMMARY:Leslieville's 20th Annual Wanderlust
DESCRIPTION:Join us for the 20th Anniversary of Wanderlust! Sip and stroll along Queen Street East from Jimmie Simpson Park to Vancouver Ave. \nExplore local shops\, galleries\, and eateries. Our BIA businesses will be hosting special promotions\, in-store activations\, and seasonal treats all afternoon! \nFeaturing Santa’s Village at Leslie Grove Park and Prize Wheel at The Grove (Queen & Pape). \nKeep an eye on our website (visitleslieville.ca) and follow us on Instagram (@LeslievilleBIA) for full promotion listings and schedule updates. We can’t wait to celebrate 20 years of Wanderlust with you!
URL:https://beachmetro.com/event/leslievilles-20th-annual-wanderlust/
