SUMMARY:Kimbourne Park United Church Annual Christmas Bazaar
DESCRIPTION:The long-running KPUC Annual Christmas Marketplace will be held on Sat. Dec.5/26 from 10:30 -3:00. We are looking to offer our space to unique Canadian vendors to promote handmade crafts\, items and services. Located at 200 Wolverleigh Blvd. Revenue from our sale goes to our mission feeding people: body\, mind and spirit. Email for more details\noffice@kpuc.org
